lank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T16:19:38-07:00","id":1116588,"title":"","content":"I have around to a line of thought that Pure Breed should not have a physical component (it should only be a spiritual phenomena).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T18:06:57-07:00","id":1116614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116588#post1116588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have around to a line of thought that Pure Breed should not have a physical component (it should only be a spiritual phenomena).</div> </div> </div> </div>Why's that?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T22:04:30-07:00","id":1116723,"title":"","content":"Well, I think that it should represent a manifestation of the ideals of the Tribe, not the ethnicity of the Tribe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T22:56:34-07:00","id":1116736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116566#post1116566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind you, I actually have it brought up in my games that Pure Breed is a completely awful background as it is literally, &quot;People respect you because of racism.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>In W20, it took on the dimension of &quot;extended service to a totem&quot; and you lost it if you went to another tribe. It also only affected how your wolf form looked. So, really, it's just overdue a name change, much like how we no longer call Ancestors Past Lives; if you just change it to reflect what it is, the vast majority of issues with the name can vanish in a flash.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T23:19:05-07:00","id":1116741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PM\u00e1rk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116560#post1116560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, but they aren't the bad guys either, at least not all of them. Also, they have a (serious) point, beside being selfish bastards, like vampires and arguably, mages. But yeah, a lot of them, maybe the majority aren't exactly progressive liberals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I have always disliked this 'garou aren't the good guys' push as much as the 'lol captain planet' stuff. And for the same reasons, actually. Because garou are as good and bad as people in general are. Their faith is not evil or good, it can just as easily be a force of both.<br /> <br /> The difference between Warhammer 40k's Imperium and the Garou Nation is, that the Imperium doesn't learn. Space Marines are still using the geneseeds of long dead primarchs, even though the Blood Angels can randomly go nuts thinking they are Sanguinus, for example. And even though Ciaphas Cain and the Space Wolves do a lot of good, their deeds are drowned out by the fact that the force of change <s> is a chaos god</s> isn't there as much in a grander scale.<br /> <br /> The Garou Nation, meanwhile, does change. Shadow Lords are at least attempting to make amends for their wrongs, Black Furies are redefining what it means to be female and tribes like Children of Gaia and Bone Gnawers are learning how to accept the modern world. Even Red Talons have a faction that tries to understand why humanity does what it does. Or smaller things like better metis acceptance and less brutal Rite of Passages.<br /> <br /> There is no need to paint the garou as darker than they all ready are, hence the purpose for this thread. Trying to insert darkness for the sake of darkness will feel clumsy, when the setting itself gives enough tools to go very dark without taking away the good entirely.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T23:49:53-07:00","id":1116747,"title":"","content":"<b>Why I prefer my Garou Nation as a bunch of awful people</b><br /> <br /> On my end, I dislike Garou whitewashing. I dislike the Get of Fenris suddenly waking up and realizing, &quot;Holy shit, white supremecists in our tribe!? GET EM!&quot; I dislike the movement of Pure Breed from what it clearly was before to something meant to be less offensive. I even have problems with Albretch because a progressive liberal Garou Nation monarch is great but does that really make for a better story?<br /> <br /> Call me crazy but I like my Garou as a bunch of regressive, angry, murderous berserkers and religious fanatics stuck with morality roughly a hundred years out of date. Plenty of them are murderous psychopaths, racists, monarchists, sexists, and bloodthirsty warrior cultists who actually are less interested in Gaia than dominating their fellow Garou as well as improving theri standing in society.<br /> <br /> In short, yes, I like them as Fuzzy Klingons.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, if that wasn't problematic enough, I like it as the player characters being dumped from generally progressive Western morality societies into this society of Proud Warrior Race GuysTM with all their counterproductive violent murder-Viking moraliy and say, &quot;These are the people you are stuck with for the rest of your life. Oh and, also, they're the only salvation for the world.&quot;<br /> <br /> I admit, this isn't going to be everyone' cup of tea but it's led to a lot of great games. I really like to beat the Evan-Heals-The-Past drum of the fact Garou society is a mess and probably a bunch of people which you'd want out of your home if not for the fact they're the only people in the world presently fighting Cthulhu-Satan along with Wolfram and Hart. Would I have liked Werewolf as much as I do now as a teenager? No, but as a 36 year old, I'm comfortable with real world awfulness being things Garou deal with.<br /> <br /> Can the PCs make a difference? Maybe. However, in my games, the biggest danger to Gaia isn't that the Wyrm is at the gates. It's the fact the Wyrm is at the gates and the majority of Garou are looking forward to Ragnarok because that's at least something they can die nobly in. PREVENTING IT by changing who they are is a much scarier prospect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T07:00:56-07:00","id":1116830,"title":"","content":"At least 80% of the Garou spend an average of 15 years being raised solely in human society and spend the rest of their lives connected to human society by their Human Kinfolk, so Garou society is human society plus. It is not like Garou have elders running around that are thousands of years old keeping to outdated ideologies. Garou society likely changes at the same pace as local human societies, the Garou are just more aware of the consequences of their actions than most humans. In addition, Garou cannot really function if they cannot relate with human society because they lack the mind controlling powers of many supernatural entities (they can breed with hesitant partners and cause terror, but they have very few other mind tricks available to young Garou).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T08:56:40-07:00","id":1116852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116747#post1116747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Why I prefer my Garou Nation as a bunch of awful people</b><br /> <br /> On my end, I dislike Garou whitewashing. I dislike the Get of Fenris suddenly waking up and realizing, &quot;Holy shit, white supremecists in our tribe!? GET EM!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The death of the Swords was actually couched in that the Swords were jumping headlong into the role of patsies for every white supremacist secret society in the WoD and not spending time doing their actual job at all. They were also presented as not just white supremacists, but sexist white supremacists that looked down on even Garou women, and disdaining lupus Garou in a tribe that venerates wolves nearly as much as the Red Talons while holding up the imagined &quot;virtues&quot; of one of the Aesir. All of that adds up to &quot;Too Dumb To Live&quot;, and those are the reasons in aggregate that the Get of Fenris killed them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T09:17:36-07:00","id":1116859,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116747#post1116747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Furthermore, if that wasn't problematic enough, I like it as the player characters being dumped from generally progressive Western morality societies into this society of Proud Warrior Race GuysTM with all their counterproductive violent murder-Viking moraliy and say, &quot;These are the people you are stuck with for the rest of your life. Oh and, also, they're the only salvation for the world.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I admit, this isn't going to be everyone' cup of tea but it's led to a lot of great games. I really like to beat the Evan-Heals-The-Past drum of the fact Garou society is a mess and probably a bunch of people which you'd want out of your home if not for the fact they're the only people in the world presently fighting Cthulhu-Satan along with Wolfram and Hart. Would I have liked Werewolf as much as I do now as a teenager? No, but as a 36 year old, I'm comfortable with real world awfulness being things Garou deal with.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Can the PCs make a difference? Maybe. However, in my games, the biggest danger to Gaia isn't that the Wyrm is at the gates. It's the fact the Wyrm is at the gates and the majority of Garou are looking forward to Ragnarok because that's at least something they can die nobly in. PREVENTING IT by changing who they are is a much scarier prospect.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I agree. I have said before that to me this is the essence of Apocalypse. The clash of moderm day value vs old. And the question what does it mean to be a good guy.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116741#post1116741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">The difference between Warhammer 40k's Imperium and the Garou Nation is, that the Imperium doesn't learn. Space Marines are still using the geneseeds of long dead primarchs, even though the Blood Angels can randomly go nuts thinking they are Sanguinus, for example. And even though Ciaphas Cain and the Space Wolves do a lot of good, their deeds are drowned out by the fact that the force of change <s> is a chaos god</s> isn't there as much in a grander scale.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">The Garou Nation, meanwhile, does change. Shadow Lords are at least attempting to make amends for their wrongs, Black Furies are redefining what it means to be female and tribes like Children of Gaia and Bone Gnawers are learning how to accept the modern world. Even Red Talons have a faction that tries to understand why humanity does what it does. Or smaller things like better metis acceptance and less brutal Rite of Passages.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I also agree, there needs to be some hope for the awfulness to have any meaning. I dislike the concept of &quot;you are X tribe and you have to think Y way&quot; for PCs (some exceptions not withstanding), i would never presents players with happy-inclusive garou nation but they sure as hell they can change it to be that (whoever little that change might be). Its also why i dislike 40k as rp setting while i love Apocalypse. In the former there is no hope of changing anything which one might as well put a bolter to ones head and pull the trigger for all the difference that would make.</span></span></span> And those progressive faction serve to give hope that thing can change.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116830#post1116830\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At least 80% of the Garou spend an average of 15 years being raised solely in human society and spend the rest of their lives connected to human society by their Human Kinfolk, so Garou society is human society plus. It is not like Garou have elders running around that are thousands of years old keeping to outdated ideologies. Garou society likely changes at the same pace as local human societies, the Garou are just more aware of the consequences of their actions than most humans. In addition, Garou cannot really function if they cannot relate with human society because they lack the mind controlling powers of many supernatural entities (they can breed with hesitant partners and cause terror, but they have very few other mind tricks available to young Garou).</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">No it isnt, Garou society as presented is not as changing as human societies. Yes 80% of the Garou are raised in human societies but how many are indoctrinated from birth the fundamentalist society of the nation. A society that put the Garou themselves in a pedestal and kinfolk in lesser role which bring the issue of abuse of power. Garou dont have inmortal elders running around but they might as well with the combined might of a fundamental society that also venerates and glorify the past, purebreed and the sort of nepotism is breeds, past lives and tribal totems all that combine makes this &quot;80%&quot; of lost cubs that enter the garou nation with moderm sensibilities to face a push back from the traditional guard.<br /> <br /> They can either play ball and embrace the old ways, reaping the benefits or make their lives a lot more harder and see their progress slowed. And thats assuming this garou survive enough, which is also a thing the Garou nation itself managed to screw up. Setting a society that rewards ala &quot;40 virgins&quot; when Garou die in battle but not when they die doing anything else which send the message that &quot;Garou should always fight&quot;</span></span></span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","user":"LokiRavenSpeak","date":". 07-16-2017, 05:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T19:11:49-07:00","id":1117042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116852#post1116852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The death of the Swords was actually couched in that the Swords were jumping headlong into the role of patsies for every white supremacist secret society in the WoD and not spending time doing their actual job at all. They were also presented as not just white supremacists, but sexist white supremacists that looked down on even Garou women, and disdaining lupus Garou in a tribe that venerates wolves nearly as much as the Red Talons while holding up the imagined &quot;virtues&quot; of one of the Aesir. All of that adds up to &quot;Too Dumb To Live&quot;, and those are the reasons in aggregate that the Get of Fenris killed them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Generally, my biggest issue with the the Swords wasn't that they existed (as werewolf racists are great villains) but the fact it's hard to imagine the Get revering what amounts to a bunch of poseurs who stole their symbols, murdered the helpless, and got themselves crushed. The Get are much more dangerous than the Nazis ever were.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-16T19:38:15-07:00","id":1117052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1116747#post1116747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, in my games, the biggest danger to Gaia isn't that the Wyrm is at the gates. It's the fact the Wyrm is at the gates and the majority of Garou are looking forward to Ragnarok because that's at least something they can die nobly in. PREVENTING IT by changing who they are is a much scarier prospect.</div> </div> </div> </div>If this was the base stance of the game as written, I'd have been a fan of it from a long time ago. Sadly, this wasn't the case when I first saw the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-n