ray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PM\u00e1rk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1118743#post1118743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I'm really curious how they'd reconcile that, since the One WoD was a big thing from the beginning of the new WW. He said they send back some of his ideas already (it was several weeks before, I think). I wouldn't be surprised if those things would be related. That's why I said back then that I' not entirely sure Kenneth Hite wants to make the same game WW wants.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the same thing I got from the K&amp;R show. Which is a bit weird, considering...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1118884#post1118884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From the Alpha test scenario &quot;Foot<br /> This is the weirdest one. If the coterie just sneaks into the wild to walk to a smaller town past the<br /> lockdown and steal a car there, they encounter -something- hunting for them. It\u2019s a Get of Fenris<br /> Lupine from the Grunewald Sept. They can run, but the wolf never loses their scent<br /> <br /> The Lupine tracker can spend Rage to gain extra actions (up to two extra per round) and<br /> regenerates one point of Superficial damage each turn. It does not suffer wound penalties and its<br /> claws and bite deal aggravated damage. Good luck! THE END&quot;<br /> <br /> That sure SOUNDS like Apocalypse stuff.. and NuWW was sure as hell talking about how the Second Inquisition ties into the Technocracy...</div> </div> </div> </div>It might. But consider Hite was not in charge for that scenario, and that the scenario was written by...<br /> This ties into <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6363_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6363\" data-vbnamecard=\"6363\">PM\u00e1rk</a> comment, really, as Hites comments are not really about the One World of Darkness that Tobias is harping about.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-24T14:55:07-07:00","id":1120089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1113278-second-impegrium-and-other-nuww-thoughts-on-wta?p=1119817#post1119817\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" clas